WEBVTT

00:26.800 --> 00:28.050
The person in the painting

00:28.050 --> 00:30.110
is the woman my mentor loved the most.

00:31.390 --> 00:32.100
So it's you.

00:34.610 --> 00:35.670
What do you mean?

00:37.740 --> 00:38.780
What does that mean?

00:38.780 --> 00:40.210
What exactly is the relationship

00:40.210 --> 00:41.170
between your mentor and mine?

00:41.170 --> 00:42.300
Explain it clearly.

00:42.650 --> 00:44.380
Actually, I'm not sure myself.

00:44.390 --> 00:45.790
I only know that my mentor

00:47.110 --> 00:49.040
waited for someone his whole life.

00:50.290 --> 00:51.280
Since I entered the mountain,

00:51.280 --> 00:52.210
my mentor told me

00:52.440 --> 00:56.430
[Memorial Tablet
of Mentor Zhang Qianzhang]

00:53.030 --> 00:54.630
that his only mission in life

00:55.000 --> 00:56.530
was to wait for a flare shot.

00:57.070 --> 00:58.470
Whoever fires the flare,

00:59.170 --> 01:00.280
my mentor must obey

01:00.470 --> 01:01.730
all of their commands.

01:02.640 --> 01:04.300
But why did it take you so long?

01:05.430 --> 01:07.230
He waited for you his whole life.

01:08.060 --> 01:08.990
I forgot.

01:10.950 --> 01:11.880
What did you say?

01:12.200 --> 01:13.789
Y-Y-You forgot?

01:14.950 --> 01:16.760
It's normal for you to be emotional now.

01:16.760 --> 01:17.890
You're still young.

01:17.900 --> 01:19.500
But you'll understand later

01:19.510 --> 01:21.900
that being too attached
only moves yourself.

01:21.900 --> 01:23.060
If your mentor was willing to wait,

01:23.060 --> 01:24.320
that was his business.

01:24.560 --> 01:26.350
Everyone has their own path.

01:28.000 --> 01:29.200
Let's talk business.

01:34.490 --> 01:36.509
How many things have you promised
others recklessly?

01:36.509 --> 01:38.340
Can you stop making reckless promises?

01:38.340 --> 01:40.009
Ordinary people have hard lives.

01:40.009 --> 01:41.280
They are not meant to play with you.

01:41.280 --> 01:43.580
But I never promised him I'd come back.

01:43.920 --> 01:45.850
And I didn't know he'd wait so long.

01:51.400 --> 01:52.259
Little Taoist,

01:53.200 --> 01:55.600
since you're the contact for the Archives,

01:56.210 --> 01:56.930
I have a question.

01:56.930 --> 01:58.660
Which one of you fire the flare?

01:59.140 --> 02:00.240
I only listen to that person.

02:00.240 --> 02:00.820
-Me.
-Me.

02:03.140 --> 02:04.460
Why are you talking nonsense?

02:04.460 --> 02:05.930
Why are you spouting nonsense?

02:05.930 --> 02:06.570
You are my mentor.

02:06.570 --> 02:07.540
Can't you be more tolerant?

02:07.540 --> 02:10.470
-Are you fighting me for it now?
-He shot it. He did it.

02:15.690 --> 02:17.690
Don't we need tokens to go to Bailejing?

02:17.690 --> 02:19.220
I heard they're hard to get.

02:20.400 --> 02:21.660
-Do you—
-Come with me.

02:28.740 --> 02:29.440
These...

02:30.560 --> 02:31.360
These

02:32.430 --> 02:34.490
are what my mentor collected for you.

02:34.750 --> 02:36.750
He thought they'd be useful one day.

02:37.060 --> 02:39.460
I didn't expect you
to be so untrustworthy.

02:42.190 --> 02:43.720
If we go, I'll only take you.

02:43.810 --> 02:44.560
Not her.

02:46.250 --> 02:47.120
If I don't go,

02:47.170 --> 02:48.150
he won't either.

02:51.130 --> 02:51.980
How about this?

02:51.980 --> 02:53.079
Give me 2 tokens,

02:53.100 --> 02:54.560
and I'll go with my mentor.

02:55.010 --> 02:56.870
The path to Bailejing is complex.

02:57.300 --> 02:58.210
Without a guide,

02:58.210 --> 02:59.470
you can't get in at all.

03:00.410 --> 03:02.440
If she goes, I won't.

03:02.740 --> 03:03.670
Then no one will.

03:04.520 --> 03:05.380
Then I won't go.

03:05.520 --> 03:06.310
You two go.

03:15.220 --> 03:16.600
Little Taoist.

03:17.860 --> 03:19.300
My mentor is sick.

03:19.800 --> 03:20.960
I brought her to Bailejing

03:20.960 --> 03:23.190
to seek treatment
from the chief of the Zhang family.

03:23.190 --> 03:23.990
Why did you...

03:26.810 --> 03:27.630
Look at you.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.130
My mentor is really dying.

03:29.130 --> 03:30.090
If my mentor dies,

03:30.090 --> 03:31.130
and you don't save her,

03:31.130 --> 03:32.560
you'd be leaving her to die.

03:32.560 --> 03:34.360
Would your conscience be clear?

03:40.180 --> 03:40.680
Then...

03:42.620 --> 03:44.020
then I'll go with you two.

03:44.130 --> 03:45.260
For no other reason,

03:45.960 --> 03:46.960
I just want to see

03:47.180 --> 03:48.840
what the woman my mentor loved

03:49.300 --> 03:50.160
is really like.

03:52.970 --> 03:54.130
Have you been to Bailejing?

03:54.130 --> 03:55.130
Of course, I have.

04:01.200 --> 04:01.700
Wait.

04:02.590 --> 04:04.190
Why are you both so arrogant?

05:41.860 --> 05:48.270
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

05:48.690 --> 05:51.250
[Episode 25]

06:26.190 --> 06:32.159
[Nanqiang to Changxiang]

06:52.510 --> 06:53.310
Come out.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.330
Let's talk.

07:12.420 --> 07:13.220
About what?

07:13.810 --> 07:15.010
Zhang Haixia.

07:15.980 --> 07:17.370
Zhang Haixia is in Mo Yungao's team.

07:17.370 --> 07:18.640
Stop joking, will you?

07:20.310 --> 07:21.420
Am I joking?

07:24.180 --> 07:25.180
Isn't that perfect?

07:25.180 --> 07:27.440
Saves you the trouble of looking for him.

07:31.130 --> 07:33.360
You two didn't hide anything else
from me before?

07:33.360 --> 07:34.250
Like what?

07:41.810 --> 07:43.340
Didn't he say anything else

07:44.130 --> 07:44.930
to you before?

07:47.180 --> 07:48.040
No.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.960
I actually want to ask you

07:51.100 --> 07:52.360
if you know something.

07:52.810 --> 07:54.610
I've told you everything I know.

08:02.220 --> 08:04.020
Shrimpie must have his reasons.

08:05.450 --> 08:06.890
It's quite unusual for Mo Yungao

08:06.890 --> 08:08.690
to suddenly appear in Nanqiang.

08:10.000 --> 08:12.640
Do you think Shrimpie
did those abnormal things

08:12.640 --> 08:14.310
just to get close to Mo Yungao?

08:15.130 --> 08:16.070
If you want to find him,

08:16.070 --> 08:17.300
go now.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.990
Leave me in peace for a while.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.060
Forget it.

08:30.020 --> 08:31.480
He might have his reasons,

08:32.600 --> 08:34.330
but you are really going to die.

08:35.500 --> 08:36.870
I'm not the same as before.

08:36.870 --> 08:38.530
I know what's more important.

08:38.960 --> 08:41.090
Let's find the chief to cure you first.

08:41.320 --> 08:43.049
We'll solve his problem later.

08:45.370 --> 08:46.550
Mo Yungao has such a large team.

08:46.550 --> 08:47.750
He'll be easy to find.

08:53.860 --> 08:54.920
Then let me ask you,

08:55.440 --> 08:56.650
if he really did something

08:56.650 --> 08:58.020
unforgivable,

08:58.770 --> 08:59.770
what would you do?

09:10.700 --> 09:12.230
Pretend it never happened.

09:14.890 --> 09:15.670
Then clean up his mess

09:15.670 --> 09:16.670
and take him home.

09:19.600 --> 09:21.260
Just like he did for me before.

09:28.440 --> 09:29.900
It's late. Stop drinking.

09:30.360 --> 09:32.160
We have to hit the road tomorrow.

10:07.940 --> 10:11.680
[Routine inspection of flare shots]

10:18.910 --> 10:21.440
[Zhang Qianzhang, the Zhang family's
contact in Nanqiang]

10:39.410 --> 10:45.210
♪ The past fades into traces on the page ♪

10:46.500 --> 10:52.210
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

10:53.600 --> 10:59.470
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

11:00.620 --> 11:05.190
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

11:06.690 --> 11:13.160
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

11:13.960 --> 11:20.110
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

11:20.860 --> 11:23.090
♪ The world's bustle ♪

11:23.670 --> 11:28.580
♪ Can briefly warm
those under a shared roof ♪

11:29.660 --> 11:35.350
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

11:31.760 --> 11:33.890
[Four months later]

11:32.360 --> 11:33.420
Will you come back?

11:33.960 --> 11:35.080
If I do,

11:35.080 --> 11:37.010
I'll let you know with a flare shot.

11:50.850 --> 11:53.730
♪ Clouds drift and fade just a few years ♪

11:57.710 --> 12:00.470
♪ Mortal world grass
regrows after parting ♪

12:06.280 --> 12:12.430
♪ Truth or lie, seasons pass
in fleeting years ♪

12:07.670 --> 12:09.000
Come on, get up quickly.

12:12.750 --> 12:14.200
From now on,

12:13.410 --> 12:19.420
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

12:13.610 --> 12:16.310
[Young Zhang Qianjunwanma]

12:14.320 --> 12:16.100
you are my beloved disciple.

12:16.700 --> 12:18.360
Your only mission in this life

12:19.210 --> 12:21.260
is to wait for a flare shot.

12:20.690 --> 12:26.670
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

12:21.720 --> 12:24.060
Whoever fires the flare,

12:24.910 --> 12:26.600
you must fulfill

12:27.410 --> 12:28.840
whatever request they make.

12:27.940 --> 12:32.400
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

12:33.560 --> 12:40.130
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

12:41.080 --> 12:47.120
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

12:47.930 --> 12:50.170
♪ The world's bustle ♪

12:50.920 --> 12:55.790
♪ Can briefly warm
those under a shared roof ♪

12:56.770 --> 13:02.050
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

13:00.750 --> 13:01.580
Mentor,

13:02.270 --> 13:03.650
this year marks your 60th year of waiting

13:03.090 --> 13:09.670
♪ Gifted to us the luck to walk
side by side a stretch of way ♪

13:03.650 --> 13:05.160
in this mountain forest.

13:06.960 --> 13:08.620
I've always wanted to ask you,

13:09.000 --> 13:10.750
how can you wait your whole life

13:10.470 --> 13:16.420
♪ After partings and meetings,
spring breeze comes round tomorrow ♪

13:11.270 --> 13:13.150
for something that seems

13:13.480 --> 13:14.620
so illusory?

13:17.020 --> 13:19.380
♪ The world's bustle ♪

13:19.900 --> 13:25.250
♪ Can keep whose dream under the roof? ♪

13:20.500 --> 13:21.030
I'm here.

13:22.220 --> 13:25.030
What can make me wait for a lifetime

13:26.150 --> 13:36.580
♪ No farewell wishes needed in this life ♪

13:27.080 --> 13:29.860
is never an arrow.

13:33.390 --> 13:34.250
Then what is it?

13:34.670 --> 13:36.030
I'm thirsty.

13:36.460 --> 13:37.920
I'll go get you some water.

13:42.820 --> 13:43.820
So,

13:46.480 --> 13:50.030
she really isn't coming back.

14:23.500 --> 14:26.300
I no longer want to wait for
other people's signal.

14:26.340 --> 14:28.270
I want to become the signal myself.

14:30.070 --> 14:33.020
[Memorial Tablet
of Mentor Zhang Qianzhang]

14:30.750 --> 14:32.150
I'll come back to see you.

14:40.350 --> 14:41.610
[Nanqiang to Changxiang]

15:01.450 --> 15:08.410
[Nanqiang to Changxiang]

15:18.300 --> 15:19.370
Deep inside Nanqiang,

15:19.370 --> 15:20.480
there are Six Great Fortresses.

15:20.480 --> 15:21.980
The outermost one is called Jinyadong,

15:21.980 --> 15:23.320
also known as Bailejing.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.480
Jinyadong is the only place

15:24.480 --> 15:26.910
where Nanqiang people
and outsiders live together.

15:26.910 --> 15:27.970
During festivals,

15:28.010 --> 15:29.480
they coat their teeth with gold powder

15:29.480 --> 15:31.200
and then gather on the streets.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.260
They're that rich?

15:32.270 --> 15:33.670
How did they make their fortune?

15:33.670 --> 15:35.440
There is a river inside Bailejing.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.720
One side leads to Jinzhou,

15:36.720 --> 15:39.250
and the other side
leads to the Hongfen River.

15:39.320 --> 15:40.320
It's a freight path
along the ancient Tea-Mule Trail,

15:40.320 --> 15:42.170
leading to the Central Plains.

15:42.270 --> 15:43.930
That's why it's so rich there.

15:44.220 --> 15:46.330
At night, it's brightly lit

15:46.360 --> 15:47.550
and bustling with people.

15:47.550 --> 15:49.960
From a distance,
it looks like a galaxy in the mountains.

15:49.960 --> 15:50.890
It's beautiful.

16:01.410 --> 16:02.670
Halt. Show your token.

16:12.630 --> 16:13.660
[Bailejing]

16:13.120 --> 16:13.790
It's fake?

17:06.170 --> 17:06.960
Let's go in.

17:08.430 --> 17:10.160
Finally, something reliable.

17:33.220 --> 17:37.420
[Bailejing]

17:54.880 --> 17:56.210
Zhang Qianjun,

17:56.940 --> 17:58.000
are you sure

17:58.000 --> 17:59.700
you're leading us the right way?

17:59.700 --> 18:01.220
This is different from what you said.

18:01.220 --> 18:02.650
Yeah, this is Bailejing.

18:02.680 --> 18:04.400
Isn't it written on the sign?

18:05.920 --> 18:07.180
I was dragged around for half a month

18:07.180 --> 18:08.330
just to see this?

18:08.420 --> 18:10.350
You know I don't have
many days left to live, right?

18:10.350 --> 18:11.810
When exactly did you come?

18:12.180 --> 18:12.790
In your past life?

18:12.790 --> 18:13.720
When I was young,

18:14.510 --> 18:16.330
my mentor brought me here a few times.

18:16.330 --> 18:17.850
But it's been a while.

18:24.610 --> 18:26.010
[Happiness after Death]

18:25.310 --> 18:26.140
Right, right.

18:27.050 --> 18:27.980
That's the place

18:28.330 --> 18:30.730
where my mentor
brought me to eat last time.

18:31.300 --> 18:32.500
[Ancient Qiang Texts]
[Happiness after Death]

18:33.480 --> 18:34.610
Is there any food?

18:36.750 --> 18:37.500
Sir?

18:38.180 --> 18:38.920
I'll do it.

18:57.250 --> 18:58.250
We got customers.

18:58.750 --> 18:59.310
Order.

19:01.570 --> 19:02.230
Okay, okay.

19:09.670 --> 19:11.800
What would the three of you like to eat?

19:12.270 --> 19:13.270
Give us some specials.

19:13.270 --> 19:14.110
Okay, okay.

19:15.270 --> 19:15.850
Hurry up.

19:15.900 --> 19:16.560
Okay, okay.

19:21.070 --> 19:22.330
All dishes are served.

19:27.400 --> 19:29.830
You really haven't eaten
anything good, have you?

19:29.830 --> 19:32.400
Sir, is this really Bailejing?

19:32.570 --> 19:34.320
Bailejing, Jinglebai,

19:34.460 --> 19:36.860
call it whatever you like.
Enjoy your meal.

19:40.110 --> 19:42.370
I think everyone here's not all there.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.580
The chief is definitely not here.

19:45.110 --> 19:46.440
Don't eat these either.

19:47.110 --> 19:48.140
Let's discuss

19:48.250 --> 19:49.480
how to find the chief.

19:49.550 --> 19:51.810
I don't know what the chief looks like.

19:52.070 --> 19:54.130
But I can take you to find him.

19:56.600 --> 19:57.510
Follow me.

20:05.030 --> 20:05.630
Mentor.

20:05.720 --> 20:07.100
The wind and waves are strong here.

20:07.100 --> 20:08.810
Is he out of his mind too?

20:12.070 --> 20:12.930
Where are they?

20:15.440 --> 20:16.900
What's wrong with you two?

20:20.010 --> 20:20.550
Well...

20:23.530 --> 20:25.330
Why is there a little chick here?

20:29.610 --> 20:31.100
This chick is quite cute.

20:31.330 --> 20:32.530
This chick is so cute.

20:51.640 --> 20:52.420
Hurry up,

20:52.810 --> 20:54.060
we're almost there!

20:54.510 --> 20:56.240
-Hurry up!
-The food is useful.

21:00.220 --> 21:00.680
Open your mouth.

21:00.680 --> 21:01.830
Follow me!

21:05.910 --> 21:06.500
Mentor.

21:21.030 --> 21:22.360
Do you feel much better?

21:26.310 --> 21:27.110
What's wrong?

21:41.960 --> 21:43.500
Outsiders can't eat

21:43.580 --> 21:45.200
the food of Bailejing.

21:45.420 --> 21:46.530
One bite,

21:47.880 --> 21:49.680
and you're dead.

21:53.200 --> 21:54.140
What do you mean?

21:54.170 --> 21:55.610
It means once you eat it,

21:56.110 --> 21:57.880
there is no turning back.

21:57.920 --> 21:59.690
Only after death can you

21:59.900 --> 22:02.750
become a true Bailejing person.

22:02.770 --> 22:04.240
True Bailejing people!

22:07.000 --> 22:07.820
You won't die.

22:08.450 --> 22:10.130
Everyone has to die!

22:11.450 --> 22:12.850
I'll take you to a doctor.

22:13.350 --> 22:13.880
Let's go.

22:14.090 --> 22:15.310
I won't let you die.

22:15.330 --> 22:16.410
All must die!

22:16.490 --> 22:17.090
Let's go.

22:17.340 --> 22:18.750
Let's go, Zhang Qianjun.

22:20.270 --> 22:21.150
Hang in there.

22:21.640 --> 22:22.770
We'll find a doctor.

22:27.140 --> 22:28.000
Zhang Qianjun.

22:29.680 --> 22:30.480
Mentor.

22:36.580 --> 22:37.100
Mentor.

22:38.980 --> 22:39.720
Mentor.

22:40.030 --> 22:40.830
Hang in there.

22:43.420 --> 22:45.180
Somebody, help!

22:45.780 --> 22:46.660
Please!

22:47.550 --> 22:48.240
Please!

22:48.740 --> 22:49.270
Mentor.

24:25.500 --> 24:27.460
So this is Bailejing.

24:39.110 --> 24:39.990
That's right.

24:40.160 --> 24:41.700
This is the familiar feeling.

24:41.700 --> 24:43.830
This is what Bailejing should be like.

24:46.200 --> 24:47.530
Shouldn't Bailejing

24:47.980 --> 24:48.980
be like what we saw just now?

24:48.980 --> 24:51.040
Why did it suddenly change into this?

24:52.660 --> 24:54.250
I have a bold guess.

24:54.610 --> 24:55.610
Is it possible

24:55.750 --> 24:57.180
that it's always been like this?

24:57.180 --> 24:58.960
It's just that the miasma here is toxic.

24:58.960 --> 25:00.070
After outsiders come in,

25:00.070 --> 25:01.750
they will be mind-controlled
by the miasma,

25:01.750 --> 25:03.310
and their behavior will become strange.

25:03.310 --> 25:05.250
Only by eating the local food

25:05.380 --> 25:06.780
can they return to normal

25:06.920 --> 25:09.250
and see the true appearance of Bailejing.

25:10.550 --> 25:12.030
No wonder.

25:12.240 --> 25:13.090
Every time my mentor

25:13.090 --> 25:14.640
brought me to Bailejing,

25:14.810 --> 25:16.410
he made me eat terrible food.

25:17.330 --> 25:19.190
So that was the food of Bailejing.

25:19.660 --> 25:20.380
Little Taoist,

25:20.380 --> 25:21.290
you just remembered

25:21.290 --> 25:24.090
such an important message.
Aren't you a bit too...

25:26.700 --> 25:28.830
Mentor, this outfit looks good on you.

25:29.790 --> 25:31.920
Mainly to avoid unnecessary trouble.

25:32.070 --> 25:34.110
It's better to do as the Romans do.

25:40.010 --> 25:40.610
He'll pay.

25:40.830 --> 25:41.400
Alright.

25:43.480 --> 25:44.080
He'll pay.

25:44.750 --> 25:45.350
Alright.

25:47.670 --> 25:49.390
Sir, you haven't paid yet.

25:54.180 --> 25:54.980
How much is it, Ma'am?

25:54.980 --> 25:55.550
Twenty.

25:55.750 --> 25:56.570
Twenty.

25:59.510 --> 26:00.480
Alright, take a look at something else?

26:00.480 --> 26:01.850
No need, thank you, Ma'am.

26:01.850 --> 26:02.510
Take care.

26:02.790 --> 26:05.520
Why did you make me pay
for the clothes you bought?

26:07.500 --> 26:08.080
What's going on?

26:08.080 --> 26:09.160
Why are you so happy?

26:09.160 --> 26:11.030
You weren't like this at all
when we were outside.

26:11.030 --> 26:11.750
Am I?

26:12.940 --> 26:14.690
It's because of the food here.

26:14.900 --> 26:16.840
The food here makes people happy.

26:17.270 --> 26:19.800
Otherwise, why would it
be called Bailejing?

26:21.920 --> 26:24.000
Fellow folks,

26:24.140 --> 26:25.640
last time we talked about

26:25.740 --> 26:27.810
the patron saint of our Bailejing,

26:27.840 --> 26:29.340
Feikun Balu.

26:31.220 --> 26:34.300
This time, I'll tell you in detail.

26:34.830 --> 26:37.670
This Feikun Balu
is a god of the mountains.

26:38.250 --> 26:39.910
He was born with divine power,

26:39.980 --> 26:42.680
controlling wind, rain,
thunder, and lightning.

26:42.680 --> 26:44.160
He is incredibly brave.

26:44.700 --> 26:45.700
Twenty years ago,

26:46.140 --> 26:47.210
there was once

26:47.420 --> 26:49.250
a notorious Black Bone Demon

26:49.310 --> 26:50.970
running amok in the villages.

26:51.030 --> 26:53.360
The common people suffered unspeakably.

26:53.750 --> 26:54.480
At this time,

26:54.750 --> 26:58.920
Feikun Balu rode the wind
with his divine weapon.

26:59.510 --> 27:01.170
Amidst the sky-shaking roar,

27:01.260 --> 27:03.390
he fought with the demon.

27:04.050 --> 27:06.250
When the divine weapon was brought out,

27:06.790 --> 27:09.810
the Black Bone Demon was no match for him.

27:10.000 --> 27:12.930
It instantly turned into blue smoke
and dissipated.

27:13.240 --> 27:15.160
From then on, Feikun Balu

27:15.420 --> 27:18.240
has protected our Bailejing day and night.

27:18.610 --> 27:22.660
No more demons
dare to set foot in our land.

27:22.750 --> 27:24.850
-Great!
-Great!

27:25.900 --> 27:27.610
Feikun Balu is just the chief.

27:28.310 --> 27:30.710
It seems that people here
treat him as a god.

27:30.770 --> 27:32.570
What's so good about being a god?

27:32.610 --> 27:34.070
It's better to be a mortal.

27:34.660 --> 27:36.090
Only when a person is dead

27:36.200 --> 27:38.660
will they know how precious
it is to be alive.

27:39.510 --> 27:41.620
This divine weapon of Feikun Balu

27:41.680 --> 27:43.540
fell right here in our Bailejing.

27:44.380 --> 27:46.430
But since it's a divine weapon,

27:46.530 --> 27:49.750
ordinary people definitely can't use it.

27:49.980 --> 27:52.070
Only when it meets its destined owner

27:52.770 --> 27:53.330
can it

27:53.590 --> 27:56.400
unleash its divine power.

27:56.420 --> 27:57.270
The priest is here!

27:57.270 --> 27:58.240
The priest is here.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.900
-The priest is here.
-The priest is here.

27:59.900 --> 28:01.340
-The priest is here.
-The priest is here.

28:01.340 --> 28:01.940
Let's go.

28:01.940 --> 28:02.900
-Let's go.
-Come on.

28:02.900 --> 28:03.590
Great.

28:03.740 --> 28:04.270
Let's go.

28:24.510 --> 28:26.310
Who is that sitting in the sedan?

28:27.110 --> 28:28.750
It's the High Priest of Bailejing.

28:28.750 --> 28:29.960
His name is Su Ya.

29:12.380 --> 29:13.780
Is that a person up there?

29:14.000 --> 29:14.660
No.

29:15.550 --> 29:16.350
It's a corpse.

29:17.420 --> 29:18.530
I heard that the people here

29:18.530 --> 29:21.250
who want to rest in peace
after death or prosper in life

29:21.250 --> 29:22.510
all need his blessing.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.480
Some people want to be high officials.

29:25.480 --> 29:27.540
Some want to be wealthy businessmen.

29:28.010 --> 29:28.700
All of this

29:29.010 --> 29:30.740
relies on him pointing the way.

29:33.090 --> 29:36.420
The life and death of the people here
are all arranged by him.

30:03.570 --> 30:04.750
He can be saved.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.440
High Priest,

30:10.610 --> 30:11.590
is it true?

30:11.750 --> 30:13.810
Can my child really come back to life?

30:14.250 --> 30:15.630
Can he really save him?

30:15.670 --> 30:17.880
-Is he lying?
-Is it true?

30:55.240 --> 30:57.770
He's really brought him back to life!
That's amazing!

30:57.770 --> 30:59.810
The priest is simply our true god!

30:59.830 --> 31:01.310
Thanks to him!

31:03.160 --> 31:05.160
-Hail the priest!
-Hail the priest!

31:05.640 --> 31:07.660
-Hail the priest!
-Brilliant!

31:08.050 --> 31:09.900
-Brilliant!
-Hail the priest!

31:10.610 --> 31:13.180
-Hail the priest!
-He knows the magic

31:13.350 --> 31:14.750
and never claims credit.

31:14.790 --> 31:17.380
No wonder the people here
love him so much.

31:18.270 --> 31:19.970
Why don't we also go

31:20.140 --> 31:21.140
channel spirits

31:21.140 --> 31:22.940
and ask if there's any news
about the chief?

31:22.940 --> 31:24.940
-Hail the priest!
-Hail the priest!

31:44.680 --> 31:45.720
Who are you?

31:45.810 --> 31:46.480
Shh.

31:47.090 --> 31:48.020
Don't be afraid.

31:48.140 --> 31:49.660
I just want to ask one question.

31:49.660 --> 31:50.980
Do you know Zhang Qiling?

31:50.980 --> 31:51.660
Guards,

31:52.070 --> 31:53.570
arrest him!

32:25.480 --> 32:26.480
Bofu (Thank you).

32:26.770 --> 32:29.100
It's my honor to protect you.

32:30.380 --> 32:32.380
I have a matter to ask you.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.570
I wonder if we could

32:33.810 --> 32:34.810
speak in private.

32:34.830 --> 32:37.110
Honored guest, thank you.

32:37.510 --> 32:39.250
Please follow me inside.

32:58.560 --> 32:59.320
Commander,

32:59.460 --> 33:00.720
there is no road ahead.

33:01.480 --> 33:02.350
Adjutant,

33:02.980 --> 33:04.270
in this situation,

33:04.380 --> 33:06.040
what do you think we should do?

33:06.200 --> 33:08.200
There is only one road to Bailejing.

33:08.380 --> 33:09.510
We have to turn back.

33:11.380 --> 33:12.420
But I'm curious.

33:13.240 --> 33:15.550
Why did you choose a dead-end road?

33:16.570 --> 33:17.750
Go to the front

33:17.770 --> 33:19.200
and set a fire.

33:19.350 --> 33:20.010
-Yes.
-Yes.

33:23.880 --> 33:25.030
Do you know

33:25.480 --> 33:28.550
what I came to Bailejing for?

33:30.090 --> 33:32.090
I'm not interested in what you want.

33:32.380 --> 33:35.180
But I won't help you find
the Zhang family's chief.

33:36.140 --> 33:37.200
You are very smart.

33:38.450 --> 33:40.310
You will find Zhang Qiling for me,

33:41.200 --> 33:42.500
because I will give you

33:43.310 --> 33:44.680
what you need.

33:45.220 --> 33:46.110
Even I don't know

33:46.110 --> 33:47.180
what I want.

33:47.790 --> 33:48.660
You do?

33:51.270 --> 33:52.570
Our eyes

33:53.530 --> 33:54.610
sit on the front of our faces,

33:54.610 --> 33:56.070
so they can look at others.

33:56.330 --> 33:58.130
That's why I can see you clearly,

33:58.750 --> 34:00.200
Zhang Haixia.

34:02.220 --> 34:03.380
However,

34:03.790 --> 34:05.680
eyes are also the most foolish.

34:06.070 --> 34:08.360
They often forget to look at themselves.

34:08.500 --> 34:09.670
Can you see

34:09.670 --> 34:11.330
how I'll eventually kill you?

34:15.650 --> 34:18.699
With all my elites around me,

34:19.130 --> 34:21.020
are you so sure you can kill me?

34:21.170 --> 34:22.170
How will you do it?

34:22.750 --> 34:23.540
Commander,

34:25.300 --> 34:26.400
you don't really think

34:26.400 --> 34:27.300
I came here

34:27.300 --> 34:29.500
just because of your phone call, do you?

34:32.250 --> 34:33.230
Have you ever considered

34:33.230 --> 34:35.040
I might have planned all this

34:35.690 --> 34:37.889
just to be within half a meter of you now,

34:38.320 --> 34:40.320
so I could kill you with my own hands?

34:45.460 --> 34:47.590
Or maybe I don't even need
to do it myself,

34:47.590 --> 34:49.250
and they can kill you for me.

34:52.480 --> 34:54.110
I like you very much.

34:57.320 --> 34:58.440
It's just a pity

34:59.380 --> 35:01.300
that you are not Zhang Qiling.

35:02.440 --> 35:03.730
You won't kill me.

35:05.110 --> 35:07.670
Because right now,

35:07.760 --> 35:10.940
you are still in trouble and confusion.

35:12.510 --> 35:14.980
Are you in pain?

35:22.110 --> 35:25.310
You thought you had made your choice,

35:25.680 --> 35:27.430
but when your mentor

35:27.460 --> 35:29.730
and Zhang Hailou appeared,

35:30.050 --> 35:33.400
you suddenly found yourself in pain again.

35:33.920 --> 35:35.320
Do you know why?

35:36.340 --> 35:40.010
It's your past self haunting you.

35:43.050 --> 35:45.850
If you want me to kill
Zhang Haiqi and Zhang Hailou,

35:46.780 --> 35:49.030
I'll kill you right now.

35:50.280 --> 35:52.480
There is no room for discussion on this.

35:56.050 --> 35:57.220
In that case,

35:58.070 --> 36:01.220
your ending will be terrible.

36:01.480 --> 36:03.480
There is only death waiting for you.

36:04.710 --> 36:06.260
Do you know what it means?

36:07.170 --> 36:10.150
It will be your past self

36:11.050 --> 36:12.280
who kills you.

36:14.280 --> 36:17.820
Actually, you've always been running away
from your past self.

36:18.340 --> 36:19.530
This is ridiculous.

36:20.210 --> 36:22.000
How can one hide from oneself?

36:22.130 --> 36:23.880
It's a pure waste of time.

36:24.550 --> 36:26.980
Remember, if you want to live,

36:28.000 --> 36:30.710
you must defeat your past self.

36:34.530 --> 36:35.230
Look.

36:37.420 --> 36:38.420
There was no path,

36:39.170 --> 36:40.710
so make one yourself.

36:41.500 --> 36:42.820
To live in this world,

36:43.530 --> 36:44.660
there is no retreat—

36:45.190 --> 36:46.520
only forward progress.

36:51.110 --> 36:51.920
Commander.

36:54.920 --> 36:56.000
I'm really glad

36:56.000 --> 36:57.820
I answered your call back then.

37:02.300 --> 37:04.630
Are you going to help me
find Zhang Qiling?

37:13.380 --> 37:14.980
In my own way.

37:15.700 --> 37:16.390
Excellent!

37:17.130 --> 37:18.000
You three,

37:18.480 --> 37:19.610
follow the adjutant

37:19.860 --> 37:21.460
and execute his every order.

37:21.650 --> 37:23.650
Violators will be killed.

37:24.360 --> 37:24.800
Yes.

37:31.940 --> 37:32.600
Commander,

37:33.340 --> 37:34.800
do you trust him that much?

37:35.460 --> 37:36.660
He's very dangerous.

37:36.690 --> 37:37.950
You are not dangerous,

37:38.070 --> 37:39.660
so you are useless.

37:45.340 --> 37:47.460
It's only fun if it's dangerous.

37:47.860 --> 37:49.340
This man

37:50.050 --> 37:51.010
won't stay.

37:51.800 --> 37:53.840
But eventually, he'll come back.

37:54.650 --> 37:57.710
He will clear all obstacles for me,

37:58.880 --> 37:59.730
because

38:00.420 --> 38:03.090
he is my third adjutant.

38:07.010 --> 38:08.440
So once he finishes

38:08.440 --> 38:10.730
doing all the dirty work for me,

38:11.090 --> 38:12.900
his time will be up.

38:13.820 --> 38:15.130
The moment he dies

38:15.500 --> 38:18.170
will mark the success of my grand plan.
